---
title:    "Operational Semantics for Declarative Multi-Paradigm Languages"
citation: "(JSC 2005)"
url:      "http://www.informatik.uni-kiel.de/~mh/papers/JSC05.html"
date:     2005-01-01
---
This paper describes an operational semantics
covering most aspects of Curry, like laziness, sharing,
concurrency, non-determinism etc.